in June and then I moved.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:48.750
- Congratulations, wow.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:49.917
- Oh, thank you.
- Yeah.

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:50.750
Oh.
- Yeah.

